{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented + landed for review (Gerrit 1463, stacked on 1457; CI Verified pending the Actions outage).\n\nCommit: b9f9eb2d172fbc7e4f647f24ed32b130135c6fe3 (\"Bank verifier AC verdicts; scale floor; read memo\").\n\nWhat shipped (per the signed-PASS plan):\n- New src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_banking.py (751 LOC): run-scoped git-ignored CriterionBank (schema-versioned, idempotent upsert by criterion_id, ticket/material-fingerprint/tree-sha stamps + successor preflight, 3000-char evidence cap + truncated flag), record_criterion_verdict tool, mint_criterion_id, plan_recovery_pool (pool = multiplier x N; N = ceil(floor/2)).\n- Reworked completion_recovery.py (733 LOC): DELETED the per-criterion fan-out; batched successor runs over the unbanked remainder under the request budget pool (per-run floor(pool/runs); iteration_limit = 2 x B; batch-shrink re-plan; zero-progress breaker); always-emit full-coverage finalizer with retry-once then deterministic no-LLM fallback (certifiable=false / finalizer=deterministic_fallback); _validate_coverage now ID-based, order-insensitive.\n- certifiable + finalizer propagate through gate_ops completion_reconcile, its yaml, and completion_reconcile_input.schema.json to the signing path.\n- Lever 1 (criteria-scaled step floor) and Lever 2 (path-normalized read_file memo) folded in per the epic-scope note.\n\nValidation (worktree venv, ruff 0.16.1 pinned):\n- tests/unit/workflow + test_completion_budget + test_agent_call_memo_nudge: 630 passed.\n- Held-out independent oracle (criterion-id minting + pool arithmetic; pinned f6fc c=8 -> pool 48/successor 16, clamp-max c=60 -> 360/120): 6 passed.\n- make lint: clean; make typecheck: Success (439 files); module-size gate: all src/rebar files <= 800 (completion_recovery 733, completion_banking 751, _config_schema trimmed to 800).\n\nLive-Bedrock AC evidence follows from this ticket's own close (dogfooding the banking verifier)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786075814180521001,"uuid":"67ed4c7a-26c6-4a27-9d8a-5b7754f0f98b"}